      "content": "Fable: \"download Unity and set up its MCP.\" Done.\n\n\"Now I want you to build a game that is a unique twist on a FPS. You want the player to say \"wow\" & \"so clever\" and to enjoy the core gameplay loop\"\n\nWebGL: swapshot-void.netlify.app\n\n* It had no assets so the graphics are procedurally generated",
