      "content": "You really need your own benchmarks. If you are translating hieroglyphics, use Gemini 3.5 Flash. If you are running a vending machine use Opus 4.8. \n\n(This is one reason why I am skeptical of just swapping out models to optimize costs or generic benchmarks without testing first)",
